  "prefLabel": "En 1502.08 Construction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.08 \"Construction\" means the installation or modification of any pipeline, cable, or conduit, or a line of poles or towers or other structures, or any wires or fixtures thereon, but does not include temporary construction as specifically defined herein.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
